# Readiness record, course format. Times are local, ISO 8601 without seconds.
test "MP7 R3 supervised hover, course field" start 2026-10-12T09:30 firmware v1.4 config c7d2
vehicle firmware v1.4 config c7d2
role pilot Mei
role observer Tunde
role supervisor Ana signed yes
# documents (category doc: valid for a year in this course's rule)
item D1 doc "authority rules read; answers recorded (lab sheet 3, 4)" status ok checked 2026-10-02T18:00 by Mei hard
item D2 doc "land-owner permission letter on file" status ok checked 2026-10-03T12:00 by Ana hard
item D3 doc "safety case checked, 0 findings (F10-36)" status ok checked 2026-10-11T16:00 by Mei hard
# the day before or the morning of the test (category day: 12 h)
item Y1 day "failsafe matrix passed on firmware v1.4 (F10-35)" status ok checked 2026-10-11T22:00 by Mei hard
item Y2 day "bench: props off, RC off -> RTL shown; battery failsafe shown" status ok checked 2026-10-11T22:30 by Tunde hard
item Y3 day "battery charged per maker's instructions; cell check logged" status ok checked 2026-10-12T07:30 by Tunde hard
item Y4 day "spare battery" status fail checked 2026-10-12T07:30 by Tunde
# on the field (category field: 60 min)
item P1 field "exclusion zone marked; spectators briefed" status ok checked 2026-10-12T09:05 by Ana hard
item P2 field "props tight; frame and wiring inspected" status ok checked 2026-10-12T09:10 by Tunde hard
item P3 field "pre-arm checks clear (compass, GNSS, RC, battery)" status ok checked 2026-10-12T09:20 by Mei hard
item P4 field "geofence and home set; RTL height above obstacles" status ok checked 2026-10-12T09:20 by Mei hard
item P5 field "kill switch tested; abort call agreed" status ok checked 2026-10-12T09:25 by Ana hard
# limits: values come from the vehicle maker's documents and the team's own test plan
limit wind_gust max 6 measured 3.5 unit m/s source "course vehicle sheet: operating limits (team test plan rev 2)"
